 1696                  * USES 7 BYTES ON THE STACK
 1697                  *
 1698 0D9E 37          MPY16  PSHB                    PUT VALUES ON THE STACK
 1699 0D9F 36                 PSHA
 1700 0DA0 A6 01              LDAA   1,X
 1701 0DA2 36                 PSHA
